<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif; 
            background: #f5f7fb; 
            padding: 20px; 
        }
        .card { 
            background: #ffffff; 
            padding: 30px; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            max-width: 600px; 
            margin: auto; 
        }
        .header { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); 
            padding: 20px; 
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; 
            color: #fff; 
            text-align: center; 
        }
        .header h1 { 
            margin: 0; 
            font-size: 24px; 
        }
        .content { 
            color: #333333; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
        }
        .credentials-box {
            background: #f0f4ff;
            border: 2px dashed #667eea;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .password {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #667eea;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .btn { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 12px 24px; 
            margin-top: 20px; 
            background: #667eea; 
            color: #ffffff; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            border-radius: 6px; 
        }
        .footer { 
            margin-top: 30px; 
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #777777; 
            text-align: center; 
        }
        .warning {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🎉 Welcome to HackByteCodex!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

        <p>Welcome to the HackByteCodex community! Your account has been automatically created because you registered for <strong><%= eventName %></strong>.</p>

        <div class="credentials-box">
            <p><strong>Your Login Credentials:</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;">Email: <strong><%= email %></strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;">Password:</p>
            <div class="password"><%= password %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="warning">
            <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Please save this password or change it immediately after logging in for security reasons.
        </div>

        <p style="text-align:center;">
            <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn">Login to Your Account</a>
        </p>

        <p>With your new account, you can:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Register for more events and hackathons</li>
            <li>Track your event participation</li>
            <li>Earn reward points</li>
            <li>Connect with other students</li>
        </ul>

        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The HackByteCodex Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> HackByteCodex. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>